              "text": "The corrected certification lowers the Stable Value Fund by $12,250. The amount is below clearly trivial ($12,610), and no note or supplemental-schedule total changes by more than that. The §103(a)(3)(C) opinion covers whether certified information agrees with the institution's certification; on the corrected figure the financial statements would differ by $12,250. I have not decided whether this needs action."
